{"id":"6029a2bde6911bbf968a58adaf6f809fecc7a25d","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/56615","title":"【论坛全程回顾】2026世界人工智能大会“从共识到行动：全球人工智能治理的可能路径” - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"清华大学人工智能国际治理研究院\n                  2026-07-25 11:30 分享","excerpt":"2026年7月18日，世界人工智能大会“从共识到行动：全球人工智能治理的可能路径”论坛在上海举行。清华大学人工智能国际治理研究院联合联合国开发计划署、儿童基金会、教科文组织、联合国大学及国际人工智能治理联盟、华为等中外机构，围绕联合国全球数字契约框架下的治理新机制、AI伦理与能力建设、多利益攸关方协同治理等核心议题展开深入研讨，旨在推动全球AI治理从理念共识迈向务实合作与制度化实践，强化跨国界、跨部门协同，助力构建包容、可信、可持续的人工智能治理体系。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"post-content\" data-v-633d9142=\"\"><html><head></head><body><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" label=\"edit by 135editor\" data-role=\"outer\" id=\"js_content\"><section><section><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;box-sizing:border-box;\" /></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\">点击蓝字</span></p></section><section><p><span leaf=\"\">关注我们</span></p></section><section><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;box-sizing:border-box;\" /></section></section><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c34f829d4ae1e5b6a2d704985ef04b5a1784950229942.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2919369786839666\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1079\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100036086\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/c34f829d4ae1e5b6a2d704985ef04b5a1784950229942.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section label=\"edit by 135editor\" data-role=\"outer\"><p><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><SPAN face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">2026年7月18日上午，2026世界人工智能大会</span></span></SPAN></span><span><SPAN face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">“从共识到行动：全球人工智能治理的可能路径”</span></span></SPAN></span><span><SPAN face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">论坛在上海</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">成功举办。清华大学人工智能国际治理研究院携手联合国开发计划署、联合国儿童基金会、联合国教科文组织、联合国大学</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">、国际人工智能治理联盟、华为技术有限公司等多家国内外机构，聚焦联合国全球数字契约框架下的治理新机制、人工智能伦理与能力建设、多利益攸关方协同治理等热点议题展开深入探讨，并集中发布了全球人</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">工智能发展与治理评估框架及相关研究成果。论坛呼应了本届大会</span></span></SPAN><SPAN face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">“智能伙伴 共创未来”的主题，旨在推动国际社会从广泛共识转向切实行动，促进全球人工智能治理体系更加包容、普惠，助力实现智能向善的可持续发展目标。</span></span></SPAN></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-videosnap data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20304/stodownload?encfilekey=KGDRibp2wkicKu5PawiauGKguoaKQ6jGzMMYLZ5SUqMHq1gHsazIFnUicKmny9pepw6O6HhY9y7b7bRia9PX58s1QAw&token=6xykWLEnztIicXqibiax4LukibaRHiasu87yDMXThlgiaO8Miaso6uHoppgPHZYXB7zahUIJJjAp9ZGjkrT6qGiaTZ2PtZXuPTAtKeicWhJkqaV75Vsy7lbvF4uicjTLolzbHO5YtshKkyGVQUFdZr9zWJoLYQueVPiaEfcHZm6kwdS9V9eShHBogOw5OcGFxtsPrGUveKlmyakhqyVWg7jSf80vXLAwA3qJMh3b8LicQH3J04OyJbY&hy=SH&idx=1&m=&scene=2&uzid=1&wxampicformat=503&picformat=200\" data-headimgurl=\"https://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/ylRhrSjQb8jx984DacjHvTDkaM6ibBwaicWHS7TdAr6bry8V02NKFVAw/0\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c4e18d1cc5d2cf00e930b07791736235862e376259a7649985551d07@finder\" data-nickname=\"THUAIIG\" data-desc=\"2026世界人工智能大会“从共识到行动：全球人工智能治理的可能路径”论坛成功举办#世界人工智能大会\n\" data-nonceid=\"9284455108443882757\" data-authiconurl=\"https://dldir1v6.qq.com/weixin/checkresupdate/icons_filled_channels_authentication_enterprise_a2658032368245639e666fb11533a600.png\" data-width=\"1280\" data-height=\"960\" data-type=\"video\" data-id=\"export/UzFfBgAAxKmAUA5fAz6GjMzT4DCLKAS9oUZjhzkCilH8CAf2fg\"></mp-common-videosnap></section></section><section data-role=\"outer\" label=\"edit by 135editor\" data-pm-slice=\"5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;box-sizing: border